.TH BBNETMON 1
.SH NAME
bbnetmon \- TCP connection state monitor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bbnetmon
\-\-list | \-\-summary [\-\-state STATE] [\-\-no-header]
.SH DESCRIPTION
bbnetmon parses procfs TCP tables and reports connection states.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help text.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B bbnetmon \-\-summary
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, non-zero on error.
